#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:509
msgid ""
"Upgrade to PublishPress Taxonomies Pro to generate separate terms for "
"multiple taxonomies in one OpenAI request."
msgstr ""
"Opgrader til PublishPress Taxonomies Pro for at generere separate "
"betegnelser for flere taxonomier i én OpenAI-anmodning."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:514
msgid "Generate separate terms for multiple taxonomies in one OpenAI request."
msgstr "Generer separate betegnelser for flere taxonomier i én OpenAI-anmodning."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:546
msgid ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to suggest new terms for your "
"content using the OpenAI, IBM Watson, Dandelion and Open Calais services. "
"These services can analyze your content and suggest new terms."
msgstr ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro giver dig mulighed for at foreslå nye termer "
"til dit indhold ved hjælp af OpenAI, IBM Watson, Dandelion og Open Calais "
"tjenesterne. Disse tjenester kan analysere dit indhold og foreslå nye "
"termer."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:565
msgid "Add Custom Elements"
msgstr "Tilføj brugerdefinerede elementer"

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:570
msgid ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you complete control over where Auto "
"Links are added. You can choose to skip any HTML elements that appear in "
"your content."
msgstr ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro giver dig fuld kontrol over, hvor Auto Links "
"tilføjes. Du kan vælge at springe over eventuelle HTML-elementer, der vises "
"i dit indhold."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:589
msgid "Use Regular Expressions to modify Auto Terms"
msgstr "Brug regulære udtryk til at ændre Auto Termer"

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:594
msgid ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to change how Auto Terms analyzes "
"your posts. You will need to know how to write Regular Expressions to use "
"this feature."
msgstr ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro giver dig mulighed for at ændre, hvordan Auto "
"Termer analyserer dine indlæg. Du skal vide, hvordan man skriver regulære "
"udtryk for at bruge denne funktion."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:616
msgid ""
"This feature allows you to connect terms. When the main term or any of "
"these terms are added to the post, all the other terms will be added also."
msgstr ""
"Denne funktion giver dig mulighed for at forbinde termer. Når den primære "
"term eller nogen af disse termer tilføjes til indlægget, vil alle de andre "
"termer også blive tilføjet."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:636
msgid "Linked Terms Feature"
msgstr "Funktion til forbundne termer"

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:640
msgid ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to create powerful connections "
"between your terms. When one term is added to a post, its linked terms can "
"be automatically added too. This helps maintain consistent organization "
"across your content."
msgstr ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro giver dig mulighed for at skabe kraftfulde "
"forbindelser mellem dine termer. Når en term tilføjes til et indlæg, kan "
"dens forbundne termer også blive tilføjet automatisk. Dette hjælper med at "
"opretholde en konsekvent organisering på tværs af dit indhold."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:658
msgid ""
"This feature allows you to associate additional words with each term. For "
"example, \"website\" can have synonyms such as \"websites\", \"web site\", "
"and \"web pages\"."
msgstr ""
"Denne funktion giver dig mulighed for at associere yderligere ord med hver "
"term. For eksempel kan \"website\" have synonymer som \"websites\", \"web "
"site\" og \"web pages\"."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:674
msgid "Synonyms Terms Feature"
msgstr "Synonymer til termer funktion"

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:678
msgid ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to have multiple words associated "
"with a single term. If PublishPress Taxonomies scans your content and finds "
"a synonym, it will act as if it has found the main term."
msgstr ""
"PublishPress Taxonomies Pro giver dig mulighed for at have flere ord "
"tilknyttet en enkelt term. Hvis PublishPress Taxonomies scanner dit indhold "
"og finder et synonym, vil det opføre sig som om det har fundet den primære "
"term."

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:698
msgid "Taxonomy Display"
msgstr "Taxonomi visning"

#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:706
#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:795
